{"number":79,"nameArabic":"النازعات","nameTransliterated":"An-Nazi'at","nameTranslated":"Those who drag forth","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":46,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"79:1","textAr":"وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَٰتِ غَرۡقٗا","transliteration":"WaalnnaziAAati gharqan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By those [angels] who extract with violence"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے اُن (فرشتوں کی) جو ڈوب کر کھینچتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"79:2","textAr":"وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَٰتِ نَشۡطٗا","transliteration":"Waalnnashitati nashtan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] those who remove with ease"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور آہستگی سے نکال لے جاتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"79:3","textAr":"وَٱلسَّـٰبِحَٰتِ سَبۡحٗا","transliteration":"Waalssabihati sabhan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور (اُن فرشتوں کی جو کائنات میں) تیزی سے تیرتے پھرتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"79:4","textAr":"فَٱلسَّـٰبِقَٰتِ سَبۡقٗا","transliteration":"Faalssabiqati sabqan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And those who race each other in a race"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (حکم بجا لانے میں) سبقت کرتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"79:5","textAr":"فَٱلۡمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمۡرٗا","transliteration":"Faalmudabbirati amran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And those who arrange [each] matter"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (احکام الٰہی کے مطابق) معاملات کا انتظام چلاتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"79:6","textAr":"يَوۡمَ تَرۡجُفُ ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ","transliteration":"Yawma tarjufu alrrajifatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس روز ہلا مارے گا زلزلے کا جھٹکا"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"79:7","textAr":"تَتۡبَعُهَا ٱلرَّادِفَةُ","transliteration":"TatbaAAuha alrradifatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"There will follow it the subsequent [one]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اس کے پیچھے ایک اور جھٹکا پڑے گا"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"79:8","textAr":"قُلُوبٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ وَاجِفَةٌ","transliteration":"Quloobun yawmaithin wajifatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کچھ دل ہوں گے جو اُس روز خوف سے کانپ رہے ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"79:9","textAr":"أَبۡصَٰرُهَا خَٰشِعَةٞ","transliteration":"Absaruha khashiAAatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Their eyes humbled"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"نگاہیں اُن کی سہمی ہوئی ہوں گی"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"79:10","textAr":"يَقُولُونَ أَءِنَّا لَمَرۡدُودُونَ فِي ٱلۡحَافِرَةِ","transliteration":"Yaqooloona ainna lamardoodoona fee alhafirati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ لوگ کہتے ہیں \"کیا واقعی ہم پلٹا کر پھر واپس لائے جائیں گے؟"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"79:11","textAr":"أَءِذَا كُنَّا عِظَٰمٗا نَّخِرَةٗ","transliteration":"Aitha kunna AAithaman nakhiratan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Even if we should be decayed bones"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا جب ہم کھوکھلی بوسیدہ ہڈیاں بن چکے ہوں گے؟"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"79:12","textAr":"قَالُواْ تِلۡكَ إِذٗا كَرَّةٌ خَاسِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Qaloo tilka ithan karratun khasiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہنے لگے \"یہ واپسی تو پھر بڑے گھاٹے کی ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"79:13","textAr":"فَإِنَّمَا هِيَ زَجۡرَةٞ وَٰحِدَةٞ","transliteration":"Fainnama hiya zajratun wahidatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, it will be but one shout"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"حالانکہ یہ بس اتنا کام ہے کہ ایک زور کی ڈانٹ پڑے گی"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"79:14","textAr":"فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ","transliteration":"Faitha hum bialssahirati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور یکایک یہ کھلے میدان میں موجود ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"79:15","textAr":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu moosa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Has there reached you the story of Moses"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا تمہیں موسیٰؑ کے قصے کی خبر پہنچی ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"79:16","textAr":"إِذۡ نَادَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ بِٱلۡوَادِ ٱلۡمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى","transliteration":"Ith nadahu rabbuhu bialwadi almuqaddasi tuwan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Tuwa"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جب اس کے رب نے اُسے طویٰ کی مقدس وادی میں پکارا تھا"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"79:17","textAr":"ٱذۡهَبۡ إِلَىٰ فِرۡعَوۡنَ إِنَّهُۥ طَغَىٰ","transliteration":"Ithhab ila firAAawna innahu tagha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہ \"فرعون کے پاس جا، وہ سرکش ہو گیا ہے"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"79:18","textAr":"فَقُلۡ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Faqul hal laka ila an tazakka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اس سے کہہ کیا تو اِس کے لیے تیار ہے کہ پاکیزگی اختیار کرے"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"79:19","textAr":"وَأَهۡدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخۡشَىٰ","transliteration":"Waahdiyaka ila rabbika fatakhsha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور میں تیرے رب کی طرف تیری رہنمائی کروں تو (اُس کا) خوف تیرے اندر پیدا ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"79:20","textAr":"فَأَرَىٰهُ ٱلۡأٓيَةَ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Faarahu alayata alkubra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And he showed him the greatest sign"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر موسیٰؑ نے (فرعون کے پاس جا کر) اُس کو بڑی نشانی دکھائی"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"79:21","textAr":"فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ","transliteration":"Fakaththaba waAAasa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But Pharaoh denied and disobeyed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"مگر اُس نے جھٹلا دیا اور نہ مانا"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"79:22","textAr":"ثُمَّ أَدۡبَرَ يَسۡعَىٰ","transliteration":"Thumma adbara yasAAa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then he turned his back, striving"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر چالبازیاں کرنے کے لیے پلٹا"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"79:23","textAr":"فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ","transliteration":"Fahashara fanada","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And he gathered [his people] and called out"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور لوگوں کو جمع کر کے اس نے پکار کر کہا"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"79:24","textAr":"فَقَالَ أَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمُ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","transliteration":"Faqala ana rabbukumu alaAAla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And said, \"I am your most exalted lord"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"میں تمہارا سب سے بڑا رب ہوں"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"79:25","textAr":"فَأَخَذَهُ ٱللَّهُ نَكَالَ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ وَٱلۡأُولَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Faakhathahu Allahu nakala alakhirati waaloola","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So Allah seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"آخرکار اللہ نے اسے آخرت اور دنیا کے عذاب میں پکڑ لیا"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"79:26","textAr":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبۡرَةٗ لِّمَن يَخۡشَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laAAibratan liman yakhsha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed in that is a warning for whoever would fear [Allah]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"درحقیقت اِس میں بڑی عبرت ہے ہر اُس شخص کے لیے جو ڈرے"}]},{"ayah":27,"verseKey":"79:27","textAr":"ءَأَنتُمۡ أَشَدُّ خَلۡقًا أَمِ ٱلسَّمَآءُۚ بَنَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Aantum ashaddu khalqan ami alssamao banaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? Allah constructed it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا تم لوگوں کی تخلیق زیادہ سخت کام ہے یا آسمان کی؟ اللہ نے اُس کو بنایا"}]},{"ayah":28,"verseKey":"79:28","textAr":"رَفَعَ سَمۡكَهَا فَسَوَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"RafaAAa samkaha fasawwaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He raised its ceiling and proportioned it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس کی چھت خوب اونچی اٹھائی پھر اُس کا توازن قائم کیا"}]},{"ayah":29,"verseKey":"79:29","textAr":"وَأَغۡطَشَ لَيۡلَهَا وَأَخۡرَجَ ضُحَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Waaghtasha laylaha waakhraja duhaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اُس کی رات ڈھانکی اور اُس کا دن نکالا"}]},{"ayah":30,"verseKey":"79:30","textAr":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ بَعۡدَ ذَٰلِكَ دَحَىٰهَآ","transliteration":"Waalarda baAAda thalika dahaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And after that He spread the earth"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِس کے بعد زمین کو اس نے بچھایا"}]},{"ayah":31,"verseKey":"79:31","textAr":"أَخۡرَجَ مِنۡهَا مَآءَهَا وَمَرۡعَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Akhraja minha maaha wamarAAaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He extracted from it its water and its pasture"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس کے اندر سے اُس کا پانی اور چارہ نکالا"}]},{"ayah":32,"verseKey":"79:32","textAr":"وَٱلۡجِبَالَ أَرۡسَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Waaljibala arsaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the mountains He set firmly"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پہاڑ اس میں گاڑ دیے"}]},{"ayah":33,"verseKey":"79:33","textAr":"مَتَٰعٗا لَّكُمۡ وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ","transliteration":"MataAAan lakum walianAAamikum","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"As provision for you and your grazing livestock"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"سامان زیست کے طور پر تمہارے لیے اور تمہارے مویشیوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":34,"verseKey":"79:34","textAr":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلطَّآمَّةُ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Faitha jaati alttammatu alkubra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر جب وہ ہنگامہ عظیم برپا ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":35,"verseKey":"79:35","textAr":"يَوۡمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَا سَعَىٰ","transliteration":"Yawma yatathakkaru alinsanu ma saAAa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس روز انسان اپنا سب کیا دھرا یاد کرے گا"}]},{"ayah":36,"verseKey":"79:36","textAr":"وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلۡجَحِيمُ لِمَن يَرَىٰ","transliteration":"Waburrizati aljaheemu liman yara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور ہر دیکھنے والے کے سامنے دوزخ کھول کر رکھ دی جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":37,"verseKey":"79:37","textAr":"فَأَمَّا مَن طَغَىٰ","transliteration":"Faamma man tagha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So as for he who transgressed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو جس نے سرکشی کی تھی"}]},{"ayah":38,"verseKey":"79:38","textAr":"وَءَاثَرَ ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنۡيَا","transliteration":"Waathara alhayata alddunya","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And preferred the life of the world"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور دنیا کی زندگی کو ترجیح دی تھی"}]},{"ayah":39,"verseKey":"79:39","textAr":"فَإِنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ هِيَ ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰ","transliteration":"Fainna aljaheema hiya almawa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"دوزخ ہی اس کا ٹھکانا ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":40,"verseKey":"79:40","textAr":"وَأَمَّا مَنۡ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ وَنَهَى ٱلنَّفۡسَ عَنِ ٱلۡهَوَىٰ","transliteration":"Waama man khafa maqama rabbihi wanaha alnnafsa AAani alhawa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جس نے اپنے رب کے سامنے کھڑے ہونے کا خوف کیا تھا اور نفس کو بری خواہشات سے باز رکھا تھا"}]},{"ayah":41,"verseKey":"79:41","textAr":"فَإِنَّ ٱلۡجَنَّةَ هِيَ ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰ","transliteration":"Fainna aljannata hiya almawa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جنت اس کا ٹھکانا ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":42,"verseKey":"79:42","textAr":"يَسۡـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرۡسَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Yasaloonaka AAani alssaAAati ayyana mursaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ لوگ تم سے پوچھتے ہیں کہ \"آخر وہ گھڑی کب آ کر ٹھیرے گی؟"}]},{"ayah":43,"verseKey":"79:43","textAr":"فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكۡرَىٰهَآ","transliteration":"Feema anta min thikraha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In what [position] are you that you should mention it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہارا کیا کام کہ اس کا وقت بتاؤ"}]},{"ayah":44,"verseKey":"79:44","textAr":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَىٰهَآ","transliteration":"Ila rabbika muntahaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"To your Lord is its finality"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس کا علم تو اللہ پر ختم ہے"}]},{"ayah":45,"verseKey":"79:45","textAr":"إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخۡشَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Innama anta munthiru man yakhshaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"You are only a warner for those who fear it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم صرف خبردار کرنے والے ہو ہر اُس شخص کو جو اُس کا خوف کرے"}]},{"ayah":46,"verseKey":"79:46","textAr":"كَأَنَّهُمۡ يَوۡمَ يَرَوۡنَهَا لَمۡ يَلۡبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوۡ ضُحَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Kaannahum yawma yarawnaha lam yalbathoo illa AAashiyyatan aw duhaha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس روز یہ لوگ اسے دیکھ لیں گے تو انہیں یوں محسوس ہوگا کہ (یہ دنیا میں یا حالت موت میں) بس ایک دن کے پچھلے پہر یا اگلے پہر تک ٹھیرے ہیں"}]}]}